<div class="grid gap-6 lg:gap-8">
  <a
    href="/features/microfrontend/"
    class="group grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900 lg:grid-cols-2"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-primary-ink uppercase dark:text-primary">01</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl dark:text-white">Microfrontend</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Host your app in an iframe. Load the SDK, call init, and talk to the shell over postMessage. The chrome stays in the host &mdash; layouts, toasts, dialogs, theme, and language included.</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Sidebar, top bar, or window layout</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Toast, dialog, modal, and drawer from the SDK</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> One <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem] dark:bg-gray-800">shellui.config.ts</code></li>
      </ul>
      <span class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary group-hover:underline">Explore microfrontend</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center bg-gray-50 p-8 dark:bg-gray-950/60 sm:p-10">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
        {% include "shell-layout-anim.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a
    href="/features/authentication/"
    class="group grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900 lg:grid-cols-2"
