      <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Staff and company owners open an embedded admin from the account menu. Manage the directory there, then inject your own apps into the sidebar from config.</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Users, organization, and join modes</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Groups, logs, tokens, and OAuth clients</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Custom admin navigation</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary group-hover:underline">Explore administration</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center bg-gray-50 p-8 dark:bg-gray-950/60 sm:p-10">
      <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm">
        {% include "feature-visual-admin.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <a
    href="/features/storage/"
    class="group grid overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-900 lg:grid-cols-2"
