    <div class="order-1 flex flex-col justify-center p-8 sm:p-10 lg:order-2 lg:p-12">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-primary-ink uppercase dark:text-primary">04</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl dark:text-white">Storage</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base/7 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">A company bucket behind the shell. New files stay private until you share them. Iframe apps upload, list, and pick files through <code class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-[0.8rem] dark:bg-gray-800">shellui.storage</code>.</p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Access grants for users, groups, or the company</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Share links with expiry and download caps</li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary">→</span> Company and per-user quotas</li>
      </ul>
      <span class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary-ink dark:text-primary group-hover:underline">Explore storage</span>
    </div>
  </a>
